by Tristen Martinez at Calyx Labs Inc.

1. DEFINITIONS
--------------
1.1 "Protocol Standard" means OpenQPEP by Calyx Labs Inc. (Beta Version 0.1.6
    and subsequent versions), including its QLX-768, QLX-1024, and QLX-2048
    7-layer NTT Module-LWE key encapsulation tiers over Z_3329[X]/(X^256+1),
    HGC-448 448-bit Goldilocks curve combiner, QVS-65, QVS-87, and QVS-128
    8-layer NTT Lattice Fiat-Shamir with Aborts signature schemes over
    Z_8380417[X]/(X^256+1), qSponge-512 and qSponge-XOF 24-round Keccak-f[1600]
    sponge primitives, Calyx-Cascade-512 (CC-512) dual-stream authenticated
    cipher cascade (AES-256-GCM + ChaCha20-Poly1305), QPKD-Argon memory-hard
    passphrase derivation lock, \x89QPE\x01\x01 binary wire framing, and the
    .qpkrf key ring file format.
1.2 "Licensor" means Calyx Labs Inc. and original creator Tristen Martinez.
1.3 "Covered Work" means the Original Work of authorship or any Derivative Work
    thereof distributed under this License.

